{"unit_id":"NormanFxxkingRockwell__dsh-auto-vision#card-zh","repo":"NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-auto-vision","commit":"ae57b74c5d87df17d0b0f0601ebc25d00ba8cccb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-vision（DSH 插件，Web/headless 客户端）：为纯文本主模型补充图片识别能力。它在 DSH 注册 vision 工具，并根据模型能力动态隐藏 read_image。主要功能有自动发现可用视觉模型、识别单张或多张本地图片、失败时切换候选模型，以及在前置钩子中尝试把粘贴图片转成文字。适合需要让文本模型理解图片文件的 DSH 用户。使用前需要在 DSH 配置至少一个声明 image 输入的模型，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:279-318","lib/index.js:364-437"]}
{"unit_id":"NormanFxxkingRockwell__dsh-auto-vision#card-en","repo":"NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-auto-vision","commit":"ae57b74c5d87df17d0b0f0601ebc25d00ba8cccb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-vision adds image recognition for text-only DSH models. Its vision tool reads local images, finds image-capable models, and retries candidates after failure. It adapts read_image access to the active model. Configure an image-capable DSH model; no extra API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:279-318","lib/index.js:364-437"]}
