{"unit_id":"NormanFxxkingRockwell__dsh-auto-vision#feature-1","repo":"NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-auto-vision","commit":"ae57b74c5d87df17d0b0f0601ebc25d00ba8cccb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"提供 vision 工具读取本地 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF 图片，并将识别结果以纯文本返回。可传单个路径或最多十张图片的路径数组，也可附加识别指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:364-437"]}
{"unit_id":"NormanFxxkingRockwell__dsh-auto-vision#feature-2","repo":"NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-auto-vision","commit":"ae57b74c5d87df17d0b0f0601ebc25d00ba8cccb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"插件会从已注册 provider 中筛选声明 image 输入的模型，并按配置偏好和用户已配置的 provider 排序；调用失败或结果为空时会继续尝试后续候选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60-103","lib/index.js:110-169"]}
{"unit_id":"NormanFxxkingRockwell__dsh-auto-vision#feature-3","repo":"NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-auto-vision","commit":"ae57b74c5d87df17d0b0f0601ebc25d00ba8cccb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"插件根据当前主模型是否支持图片动态限制 read_image：文本模型会隐藏该工具，切换到支持图片的模型后会撤销限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:279-318"]}
{"unit_id":"NormanFxxkingRockwell__dsh-auto-vision#feature-4","repo":"NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-auto-vision","commit":"ae57b74c5d87df17d0b0f0601ebc25d00ba8cccb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"启用转述钩子时，插件尝试将消息中的图片块交给视觉模型，再用带有图片转述标记的文本替换；失败时保留后备提示文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:193-225","lib/index.js:320-352"]}
{"unit_id":"NormanFxxkingRockwell__dsh-auto-vision#caveat-1","repo":"NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-auto-vision","commit":"ae57b74c5d87df17d0b0f0601ebc25d00ba8cccb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-vision 使用前须知：视觉模型必须已在 DSH 注册并声明 image 输入；插件启动时找不到候选模型会报错。粘贴图片转述虽有钩子实现，但纯文本模型的图片消息受宿主准入限制时无法触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:234-276","lib/index.js:320-352"]}
